, "title": "I WAS TELLING THE TRUTH\n\nThe Chester County, Pennsylvania, non-juror list contains 65 pages of non-citizens \n\nthat have been summoned for jury duty. \n\nIf this is happening in Chester County, it\u2019s happening everywhere.\n\nPass the SAVE America Act!", "last_comment_created": 1784952372102, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 60, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 470, "created": 1784935803000, "id": "2080797691366240285", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2080797557383483393/img/1mJwqDAUhlJnzDIJ.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2080797557383483393/pl/rPKTqDVjNzdo-1fK.m3u8?v=cfc", "aspectRatio": [603, 1220], "heightRatio": 202, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2080797557383483393/vid/avc1/320x646/ieq779rKmi9bqVbs.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1321124227215491072/pIC0lG5M_normal.jpg", "displayName": "ThePersistence", "username": "ScottPresler"}, "content": "\ud83d\udea8I WAS TELLING THE TRUTH\ud83d\udea8\n\nThe Chester County, Pennsylvania, non-juror list contains 65 pages of non-citizens \n\nthat have been summoned for jury duty. \n\nIf this is happening in Chester County, it\u2019s happening everywhere.\n\nPass the SAVE America Act!", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 13644}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATC02YGQO", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 101, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8745484, "raw_content": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/24/british-born-man-living-in-us-since-age-of-nine-held-by-ice-under-threat-of-deportation\n\nHe only went back to the UK once. He has a wife and children. He has a job. HOW DARE ICE DO THIS!!!!???\n\nOh, he was also ordered to be deported in 2011. He received a temporary relief from that through DACA in 2016 (why was he allowed to remain for 5 years?) But then he broke the law - was caught with drugs and resisted arrest. The relief was rescinded.\n\nHe was in the country illegally. He should have been deported in 2011.", "author": "conservativefrank", "created": 1784930886215, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "AwShitHereWeGoAgain", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "British Born Man Who Has Been In US Since Age Nine Held By ICE for Deportation", "last_comment_created": 1784936199073, "content": "<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/24/british-born-man-living-in-us-since-age-of-nine-held-by-ice-under-threat-of-deportation\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/24/british-born-man-living-in-us-since-age-of-nine-held-by-ice-under-threat-of-deportation</a></p>\n<p>He only went back to the UK once. He has a wife and children. He has a job. HOW DARE ICE DO THIS!!!!???</p>\n<p>Oh, he was also ordered to be deported in 2011. He received a temporary relief from that through DACA in 2016 (why was he allowed to remain for 5 years?) But then he broke the law - was caught with drugs and resisted arrest. The relief was rescinded.</p>\n<p>He was in the country illegally. He should have been deported in 2011.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "c